{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107700","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107700","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710770001:1":{"text":"请原谅我的惊讶。但就在刚才，这座大厅还空无一人。可否请哪位告诉我……这片刻之间，诸位究竟去了哪里？","source_cn":"请原谅我的惊讶。但就在刚才，这座大厅还空无一人。可否请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3532B15F6B7526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710770002:1":{"text":"看你们的神色，并非在享受一场美妙的晚宴啊……","source_cn":"看你们的神色，并非在享受一场美妙的晚宴啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE38A45EAE08BC66B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710770003:1":{"text":"迪尔格雷大人！您来得正好！ ","source_cn":"迪尔格雷大人！您来得正好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6B8DD85A9E8AD79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710770004:1":{"text":"我们、我们去了圣古堂！那个消失的圣古堂！","source_cn":"我们、我们去了圣古堂！那个消失的圣古堂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F5D5C9F5F29C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710770005:1":{"text":"不仅如此！还有……还有魔物！就是史书上的那个魔灵镜影！","source_cn":"不仅如此！还有……还有魔物！就是史书上的那个魔灵镜影！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC9EE2412B0E6F26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710770006:1":{"text":"但！但是王子殿下……奥利安殿下他……","source_cn":"但！但是王子殿下……奥利安殿下他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBE72B6EA9A370F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710770007:1":{"text":"王子殿下是英雄！他、他把那个魔物打倒了！","source_cn":"王子殿下是英雄！他、他把那个魔物打倒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x679B264115FCAB19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710770008:1":{"text":"就像罗兰大帝一样！我们都亲眼看到了！","source_cn":"就像罗兰大帝一样！我们都亲眼看到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16F0DC28A0AD76C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710770009:1":{"text":"哦？竟有此等神迹……","source_cn":"哦？竟有此等神迹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74C780C8CBF3C0E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710770010:1":{"text":"……等等。既然魔物被打倒了，我们也都回来了……","source_cn":"……等等。既然魔物被打倒了，我们也都回来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6C403E774828279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710770011:1":{"text":"王子殿下呢？","source_cn":"王子殿下呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68203EE23053C88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710770012:1":{"text":"难道……殿下他为了救我们，还被困在那该死的教堂里？！","source_cn":"难道……殿下他为了救我们，还被困在那该死的教堂里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2260848BDBDA5CBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710770013:1":{"text":"这……这可如何是好！","source_cn":"这……这可如何是好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14C65680FA027199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710770014:1":{"text":"……迪尔格雷卿，你是宫廷首席法师。对此，你有什么看法？","source_cn":"……迪尔格雷卿，你是宫廷首席法师。对此，你有什么看法？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFDDF06C00923F5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710770015:1":{"text":"诸位，请冷静。请仔细回想你们所见证的一切。","source_cn":"诸位，请冷静。请仔细回想你们所见证的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2D26369D913C74F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710770016:1":{"text":"这……您的意思是？","source_cn":"这……您的意思是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285EA063AEF4F962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_